SUMMARY:[Deep Representation Learning][Machine Learning] ICLR 2027 - Abstra
 ct submission deadline
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: International Conference on Learning Represen
 tations\nWebsite: https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2027\nSource URL: https://i
 clr.cc/Conferences/2027\nLocation: San Francisco\, California\, USA\nTopi
 cs: Deep Representation Learning\, Machine Learning\, Explainability & In
 terpretability\, Robustness & Safety\nSize: XXL\nSubmission type: Paper-b
 ased / OpenReview\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-28\n
 Notes: Official ICLR 2027 pages (checked 2026-10-28) list Apr 26-30\, 202
 7 (main Apr 26-28\, workshops Apr 29-30) and Sep 18 abstract/Sep 25 paper
  deadlines (AoE)\; submissions are closed. The site header says Californi
 a and OpenReview lists San Francisco\, CA\; the Dates page still shows 'l
 ocation to be announced' boilerplate.\nScope: Learning representations an
 d understanding deep learning\, with an emphasis on self-supervised learn
